Package: cornfab
Title: Text-to-Speech Web App
Version: 0.0.3.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Troy", "Hernandez", email = "troy@cornball.ai",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-4248-604X")),
    person("cornball.ai", role = "cph"))
Description: A web application for generating speech from text using
    'tts.api'. Enter text, select a voice and backend, and generate
    audio files, with voice cloning and voice design where the backend
    supports them. Built on 'glinty', so the only web dependencies are
    'jsonlite' and 'digest'. Alpha: unreleased, and still changing
    with 'glinty' underneath it.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    glinty (>= 0.0.5.28),
    jsonlite,
    stats,
    tools,
    tts.api
Suggests:
    chatterbox,
    gpu.ctl,
    pkgload,
    tinytest
Remotes:
    cornball-ai/glinty,
    cornball-ai/tts.api
